Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: SM7250 and OnePlus Nord (avicii)

Combined diff of the following commits (base v7.3-rc7):

  - arm64: dts: qcom: Add SM7250 devicetree file
  - arm64: dts: qcom: add OnePlus Nord (avicii), USB and reserved-memory fixes for SM7250
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add apps SMMU and APSS watchdog
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add TLMM pin controller and debug UART pinctrl
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add UFS host controller and PHY
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: enable UFS and add PM8150/PM8150L regulators
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: add PM8150 PON with reboot-mode
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: reserve TZ-owned GPIOs
  - ufs: qcom: limit SM7250 to 32-bit DMA; avicii: keep boot rails always-on
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add TSENS and thermal zones with cpufreq cooling
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: add PM8150L, PM7250B, power and volume keys
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add QUP wrappers with iommus, i2c11 and the bq27541 gauge
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add display pipeline and enable the avicii panel
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add IPCC, AOSS QMP, modem SMP2P, MPSS and WCN3990 Wi-Fi
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: enable modem and Wi-Fi
  - arm64: dts: qcom: pm7250b, sm7250-oneplus-avicii: Add charger node
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: restore closing brace lost in merge
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: restore wifi status lost in merge
  - pmdomain: rpmhpd: add QPHY for SM7250 and let the UFS PHY hold it
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: enable USB-C OTG with the PM7250B type-C port
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: fix battery gauge compatible, link it to the charger
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add GPU, GMU, GPU clock controller and GPU SMMU
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add GPI DMA and QUP wrapper 1 SE1 I2C
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: add the Goodix GT9886 touchscreen
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: align the GPU zap shader region to 4 KiB
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: Add ADSP remoteproc with APR services and QUP I2C9
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: Enable ADSP and the speaker amplifier I2C bus
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-oneplus-avicii: Add speaker playback via Primary MI2S
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: Add ADSP FastRPC node

